{"unit_id":"qzz19970504__dsh-model-picker-control#feature-2","repo":"qzz19970504/dsh-model-picker-control","commit":"958dee1ca18b6c76017166110ad2d4b5578a7514","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-control 的功能「名称、隐藏与标签」：可分别自定义服务商组名和模型显示名，隐藏单个模型或整个服务商，并添加不同颜色的后缀胶囊。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/pipeline.js:146-166","src/pipeline.js:118-132"]}
{"unit_id":"qzz19970504__dsh-model-picker-control#feature-3","repo":"qzz19970504/dsh-model-picker-control","commit":"958dee1ca18b6c76017166110ad2d4b5578a7514","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-control 的功能「分组和模型排序」：可拖动调整分区顺序，并按目录顺序、模型名称或手动顺序排列每组模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/pipeline.js:177-187"]}
{"unit_id":"qzz19970504__dsh-model-picker-control#feature-4","repo":"qzz19970504/dsh-model-picker-control","commit":"958dee1ca18b6c76017166110ad2d4b5578a7514","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-control 的功能「模型文件夹接力」：把同一分组中的多个模型组成文件夹；请求失败时根据失败类型暂时停用当前成员，切换到下一个可用模型并重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/relay.js:120-145"]}
{"unit_id":"qzz19970504__dsh-model-picker-control#feature-5","repo":"qzz19970504/dsh-model-picker-control","commit":"958dee1ca18b6c76017166110ad2d4b5578a7514","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-control 的功能「选择器和弹窗同步」：composer 模型选择插槽与 /model 弹窗使用相同的整理后模型分组；选择仍交给 DSH 的模型目录处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:34-39","src/client/index.js:123-130"]}
{"unit_id":"qzz19970504__dsh-model-picker-control#caveat-1","repo":"qzz19970504/dsh-model-picker-control","commit":"958dee1ca18b6c76017166110ad2d4b5578a7514","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-control 使用前须知：模型文件夹的会话绑定和冷却状态会写入本机的 DSH state 目录；该目录由 DSH_HOME 决定，未设置时使用 ~/.dsh/state。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-127"]}
